                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Uriel is held by the five Bonds (§05). This block is Uriel with <b>all five intact</b>: <b>slowed 2</b>, can't Fly, can't leave the Seat, can't use The Word. Each Bond destroyed: reduce his slowed by 1 (min 0), and his Strikes and DCs each gain a cumulative <b>+1 status bonus</b> (max +5). At three Bonds down, The Word unlocks. Destroy all five and he is <b>Unbound</b> — stop running this block (§07).</p>"
                },
