                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><b>0 HP with any Bond still standing:</b> he goes dormant, the Seat re-seals, and the Glasslands seal sets <em>measurably stronger</em> over 1d10 days — the Choir loses decades of work. A real win that doesn't end the threat, and buys the setting years. <b>0 HP with every Bond already gone:</b> he isn't dying. See The Binding and §07.</p>"
