                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Choir doctrine holds — unconfirmed — that a soul walked all the way through the gate by an Ashcantor's sacrament, into the empty Seat, could take up the Binding in his place and let him rest without waking. If a player wants this ending it's available; whose soul, and whether it holds, is the table's to set.</p>"
